# PROJECT TITLE
AI-Powered Multimodal Construction Intelligence Platform

## 1. ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, AI/ML engineer, UI/UX designer, and construction technology specialist.

Build a complete, modern, production-oriented full-stack web application called **AI-Powered Multimodal Construction Intelligence Platform**.

The application must help construction engineers, site supervisors, project managers, contractors, safety officers, and real estate professionals make informed decisions using artificial intelligence.

The system must accept and analyze:
- Textual user inputs.
- Construction site photographs.
- Project-related structured data.
- Weather information.
- Construction planning and monitoring information.

Use a multimodal large language model to generate context-aware insights and actionable recommendations.

Do not build only a static landing page or a UI prototype. Build a functional application with a frontend, backend API, AI integration, validation, error handling, and persistent storage.

If a capability requires an external service or API key, implement the integration point and provide a working fallback or clearly explain what configuration is required.

